Q=[
('AG9-Q01',IDS,
 'All nine Core entries use Action,120feet,V/S/F and rank9 base26RP. Eight are Wizard-only Enchantment; ProphecyFulfilled has Cleric/Wizard Divination access,all at class17.',
 'A: preserve exact access and casting, completing only identified fields. B: explicitly justified source correction with the complete original retained.',
 'Recommend A. Repertoire,real Action,components,normal payment/strain/counter and one concentration slot remain. Do not grant rank9 access from names,other class levels or sufficient RP. Actual Ready chooses its lawful targets at release under the accepted contract while retaining preparation-bound mode/command choices; no second cast or hidden-information lookup.'),
('AG9-Q02',IDS,
 'Shared source-character/target/encounter hard-control admission already applies to ordinary spells. Lower Enchantment command,companion and virtual-cycle completions have named scopes.',
 'A: retain the global hard-denial guard and explicitly bind only the necessary instruction/cadence interfaces for each new spell. B: identify a real source conflict and propose an explicit narrow exception.',
 'Recommend A absent an actual contradiction. Claim a successfully established hard component once,never per ongoing turn. Initial prevention creates no banked hard component; suppression/replacement does not refund history. Preserve independently meaningful printed soft components without inventing fallback benefits. Charmed immunity does not block a spell that never applies Charmed; creature type alone supplies no blanket mental immunity. Specify actual component classifications,not name-based aliases.'),
('AG9-Q03',['absolute-domination'],
 'Control ANY CREATURE for1minute,with WIS SAVE AT END OF EACH TURN; Core explicitly concentration and Wisdom save.',
 'A: one perceived creature,initial WIS plus the expressly printed each-actual-turn END escape. B: no initial save,with only printed ending resistance,as an acknowledged interpretation.',
 'Recommend A with the initial-save interpretation disclosed. Preserve any-creature eligibility without importing DominateMonster CR10 or creature-type caps. Explicit each-turn text includes genuinely inserted target turns,unlike a merely inherited regular-END default. Source-defined immunity and the shared admission guard remain. Do not turn each-turn saves into extra actions or let suppressed conditions erase the original save schedule.'),
('AG9-Q04',['absolute-domination'],
 'Control does not specify command channel,cost,order scope or permitted resource expenditures.',
 'A: source-specific mental orders at real target opportunities using a disclosed extension of DominatePerson. B: direct broader command authority with an explicit finite-resource/self-harm policy.',
 'Confer on the full useful authority. Do not silently copy lower-rank restrictions or assume the title grants unrestricted spellcasting,private knowledge or suicidal orders. Define who chooses exact methods and targets,what the caster must know,ordinary Attack versus special actions,BA/Reaction/extra-Action control and order cost. Preserve actual budgets and paid resources; a broader permission must be expressly NEW,not obtained through an example.'),
('AG9-Q05',['absolute-domination'],
 'The target may have independent turns or only an original-owner attached phase; orders can conflict or lose their channel.',
 'A: explicit opportunity and same-plane communication bridge,with real attached phases only and no feedback. B: a justified different channel and timing contract.',
 'Select exact creation-turn eligibility,outside-initiative cycle,transition budgets,owner unconsciousness,range/plane loss and finite command expiry. An attached phase is not each actual target turn; any substitute save or order marker must be separately scoped. Keep original companion command/offense caps and owner budgets unless an explicit exception is chosen. Define same/different-caster replacement and older-order priority; an invalid new order cannot erase a live older one.'),
('AG9-Q06',['command-reality'],
 'ONE CREATURE must obey a ONE-SENTENCE COMMAND unless WIS resists. No printed one-word or reasonable-suggestion restriction.',
 'A: one coherent finite sentence with explicit hearing/understanding and command grammar. B: a separately authored nonauditory delivery channel.',
 'Recommend a complete sentence envelope,not conversion into ordinary one-word Command or optional advice. Define conjunctions,conditional clauses,multiple sequential steps,referents,language and disclosure after payment. Distinguish lawful complex conduct from several independent orders disguised by punctuation. No arbitrary word cap is recovered source; if needed,justify its actual gameplay limit.'),
('AG9-Q07',['command-reality'],
 'Core Instantaneous does not define how long obedience persists or when a multistep command finishes.',
 'A: one next real ordinary-turn opportunity with sentence-sized conduct inside its actual budget. B: a finite task lasting to completion or an expressly selected maximum.',
 'Director must select the duration and explain the gameplay consequence. A one-turn limit is a NEW substantive completion,not printed authority; B needs its full deadline,concentration and conduct rules. Preserve the intended useful sentence compulsion. No indefinite obey-me relationship by grammatical trick,free Action,automatic skill success or time reset at initiative transitions.'),
('AG9-Q08',['command-reality'],
 'The source leaves harmful acts,spell/resource use,secret disclosure,oath violations and impossible instructions unresolved.',
 'A: an explicitly scoped permitted/prohibited conduct table. B: broader compulsory agency with each override and resource consequence expressly selected.',
 'Confer on these consequential choices instead of automatically inheriting every lower-rank safe-command limit. A command can use only actually possessed capabilities; hidden availability does not become an identification oracle. Reserve required hard control at establishment,choose no new sentence after a failed save or invalid result,and define whether only an independently meaningful original soft portion survives. Same-spell replacement,other-spell arbitration and actual ending/removal must be explicit.'),
('AG9-Q09',['dominate-legion'],
 'Control UP TO TEN CREATURES SIMULTANEOUSLY; Core concentration1minute and generic automatic/opposed resolution.',
 'A: one to ten distinct perceived creatures within120ft,each initial WIS and independent control admission. B: another explicitly selected resistance model.',
 'Recommend A as NEW resistance/target completion while retaining all ten potential recipients and the minute. No CR/type limit,shared HP pool or single creature substituted for the legion. Freeze the selected list before hidden results; saved or immune recipients do not grant outcome-driven retargeting. Self-targeting and willing acceptance must follow an explicit source rule rather than auto-failure.'),
('AG9-Q10',['dominate-legion'],
 'Ten recipients may require different orders on different initiatives; command channel and cost are unspecified.',
 'A: per-recipient orders at each actual eligible opportunity through one maintained spell. B: a caster-issued batch with explicit cost and retention.',
 'Choose the command budget and independent versus shared instructions without quietly limiting the spell to one functioning controlled creature. State precise order timing,communication,consciousness,plane/range requirements and whether preissued orders persist. Ordinary Actions,Attack sequences,BA,Reactions,extra Actions,spells and limited resources need explicit authority. No new turn,omniscient inventory view or shared target perception arises.'),
('AG9-Q11',['dominate-legion'],
 'Neither repeat escape saves nor roster replacement is printed; each recipient has independent lifecycle and suppression.',
 'A: an expressly NEW regular-END WIS escape per recipient and a fixed ten-target roster. B: no repeat saves,or another justified finite resistance policy.',
 'Select rather than infer repeat saves from concentration. Specify whether damage creates any escape event; it is not printed. Ending one recipient does not end all others or free a slot for a new creature. A maintained spell can retain its remaining original recipients; each keeps application IDs,hard history and original maximum. Recasts and cross-caster collisions must state which individual components replace and when displaced concentration ends.'),
('AG9-Q12',['dominate-legion'],
 'Multiple controlled creatures may be companions sharing one original owner and limited command/offensive resources.',
 'A: explicit original-chassis bridges that retain all real shared limits. B: a narrowly authored paid exception to a named companion budget.',
 'Recommend A unless the complete source justifies B. Ten listed bodies cannot each manufacture an original-owner Bonus Action,offense allowance,phase or resource. Select exactly who issues a command,who pays any real cost,and how incompatible owner/controller instructions arbitrate. Use actual complete companion source profiles for positive cases; hypothetical CR or attack values cannot clear a content hold. Preserve outside-initiative spent budgets on transition.'),
('AG9-Q13',['erase-soul'],
 'Target forgets who they are; cannot act for3rounds (NO ACTION,WIS NEGATES EARLY),while Core lists1Action casting.',
 'A: no action describes the victim denial or no-cost ending save,retaining the caster Action. B: free casting as an explicit conflicting-source interpretation.',
 'Recommend A. Preserve both originals and spell out the selected reading; parenthetical wording must not silently grant free rank9 casts. Clarify whether application has an initial WIS in addition to early ending saves or automatic initial denial under real admission. A 26RP/Action commitment still pays on a resisted or prevented effect.'),
('AG9-Q14',['erase-soul'],
 'Cannot act and forgetting identity do not enumerate Action,BA,Reaction,movement,speech or stored class knowledge.',
 'A: a named three-round denial component plus a separately defined temporary identity-belief overlay. B: another exact component model preserving both printed benefits.',
 'Define the denial fully without casually reducing it to ordinary Incapacitated or silently adding paralysis,all-save failure or death. If Incapacitated is actually selected,its concentration consequences follow; otherwise no assumed concentration loss. Keep class ownership,RP,inventory,memory originals and real person identity. The name EraseSoul does not destroy a soul,change Hunt finality or grant resurrection prevention.'),
('AG9-Q15',['erase-soul'],
 'WIS negates early and3round duration lack exact save opportunities and final ordering.',
 'A: one WIS at each affected regular END,with a three-future-regular-END maximum under the native hostile clock. B: a different explicit early-save cadence.',
 'Recommend an explicit clock matching the accepted control framework,including any affected current-END save and final expiry order. Define whether success ends both denial and identity overlay. Attached phases need a real source-specific bridge; out-of-initiative behavior cannot create new budgets. Suppression preserves deadlines and scheduled saves; gaining an immunity suppresses only covered components and cannot refund hard history or restore previously lost concentration.'),
('AG9-Q16',['overwhelming-presence'],
 'CREATURES must bow/worship or be frightened; Core120ft range,concentration1minute and AppropriateSavingThrow leaves area/count/save open.',
 'A: a disclosed fixed or following field with a defined radius,one initial WIS per recipient. B: a finite selected creature list and exact resistance policy.',
 'Confer on geometry and selection;120ft is casting range,not automatically radius or unlimited world reach. Specify actual perception/LoE,friend/self inclusion,first exposure,cover,entry/exit and consciousness if an aura. NEW radius and save choices must be visible in decisions; do not silently reduce plural creatures to one target.'),
('AG9-Q17',['overwhelming-presence'],
 'The actual alternative is BOW AND WORSHIP YOU OR BE FRIGHTENED,not simple unconditional fear.',
 'A: each affected target/controller chooses actual outward submission versus the named Frightened effect. B: automatic submission with an explicit resistance/alternative mechanism.',
 'Recommend preserving a real target choice. Define bowing anatomically without automatically importing Prone,full Action loss or kneeling capability; if Prone is selected,apply its genuine movement/stand rules. State worship conduct and action/speech demands. Compelled performance establishes no sincere faith,deity identity,permanent loyalty or true cosmological authority. No extra hidden penalty replaces a forbidden or impossible posture.'),
('AG9-Q18',['overwhelming-presence'],
 'Choice frequency,fear immunity,submission interruption and suppression could otherwise create forced fallback or repeated hard admission.',
 'A: fixed per-application decision with expressly stated later change conditions. B: fresh choices at specified real opportunities without refreshed resources.',
 'Select the timing and whether a fear-immune creature can choose an ineffective fear branch. Immunity is not automatic forced worship. If submission actually denies a whole Action,define establishment-time hard admission independently; no delayed claim after a soft branch was admitted. Describe own attacks,standing/departure,damage,repeat saves if NEW and independent CalmEmotions suppression. Do not reset histories on cover or reentry.'),
('AG9-Q19',['perfect-mesmerize'],
 'One creature is stunned,silent,defenseless FOR FULL DURATION UNLESS DAMAGED; Core says Instantaneous.',
 'A: an explicitly NEW finite maintained duration,for example one minute,with a selected concentration policy. B: an enduring effect until its printed damage break/removal with full persistence rules.',
 'Director must select a real useful duration. Instantaneous cannot silently erase the promised continuing benefit. If an initial save is added,state ability and success outcome as NEW; do not add repeated escape saves merely because another control spell uses them. Preserve the full-duration-unless-damaged clause and distinguish other universal endings such as actual dispel/death.'),
('AG9-Q20',['perfect-mesmerize'],
 'STUNNED,SILENT and DEFENSELESS are three printed clauses; Stunned permits only faltering speech but does not itself mean silent.',
 'A: native Stunned plus separately source-bound silence and a concrete defensive-permission reduction. B: a different disclosed component completion preserving every clause.',
 'Define defenseless explicitly: which Guard/cover/AC/Reaction/defense permissions change and which remain. No automatic critical hit,zeroAC,loss of armor/resistance or instant death is printed. Use actual components so Stun-only or Silence-only immunity affects only its scope. Stun can end concentration at actual application; later immunity does not restore it. Do not treat the separate silence clause as redundant and discard it.'),
('AG9-Q21',['perfect-mesmerize'],
 'UNLESS DAMAGED needs exact break timing after mitigation,tempHP and damage sharing.',
 'A: break after this recipient actually takes positive source-qualified damage,including tempHP absorbed,under its complete damage pipeline. B: a different explicit qualifying-damage boundary.',
 'Recommend a named actual-damage predicate,not hit alone or a predefense roll. Fully prevented damage and pure HP cost are distinct; decide whether a positive packet at an HP floor with zero actual loss qualifies. The triggering attack uses defenses valid at its own snapshot,then cleanup occurs at the selected post-damage checkpoint. Redirected-away damage cannot falsely wake the original body; an actual incoming transfer must be evaluated under its own real event. Keep one Wound/root history and no duplicated packet.'),
('AG9-Q22',['perfect-mesmerize'],
 'Independent immunity,suppression and later damage interact with one application and spent hard history.',
 'A: one application with independent established components and a common actual damage-ending event. B: separately ended components with an explicitly justified relationship.',
 'Select whether qualifying damage during suppression still ends the underlying spell; suppression is not removal. Define initial blocked hard component versus any meaningful printed silence/defense remainder,without inventing a substitute. Different-caster overlap,removed components,expiry and already-ended callbacks must not resurrect effects or refund admission. A fixed full-duration effect has no hidden repeat save unless the conference expressly chooses one.'),
('AG9-Q23',['prophecy-fulfilled'],
 'Declare ONE CREATURE\'S NEXT ACTION; it must succeed INT or do it. No action category or communication channel is specified.',
 'A: one concrete legal ordinary Action declared before the initial INT save. B: broader next-action vocabulary with each controlled budget explicitly listed.',
 'Recommend a clear Action object and real targets/method choices,not a vague prediction that guarantees success. Decide hearing/understanding versus a new mental channel. Attack,spellcasting,consumables,limited abilities,secret disclosure,self-harm and known duty violation require a source-specific conduct decision. Availability comes from actual repertoire/resources; the caster gains no free hidden-state test.'),
('AG9-Q24',['prophecy-fulfilled'],
 'Next action could mean the next ordinary Action,an inserted-turn Action,an extra Action or any small interaction.',
 'A: next qualifying genuine ordinary Action opportunity with an expressly fixed finite marker. B: the very next committed matching action across explicitly listed budgets.',
 'Director must choose the exact opportunity without importing regular-only Command timing automatically. Do not let the target evade a compelled ordinary Action by voluntarily refusing to act unless that is the chosen policy. No out-of-turn Action or BA/Reaction expenditure is created. Reserve actual hard control at establishment and preserve other mandatory instructions,spent budgets and real incapacity. Extra turns do not refresh ordinary resources.'),
('AG9-Q25',['prophecy-fulfilled'],
 'Core Instantaneous leaves an unperformed future Action pending without a defined expiry or suppression policy.',
 'A: expiry after the original next qualifying opportunity,with a bounded elapsed fallback for genuine absence. B: a different explicit finite deadline.',
 'Require a useful positive execution before typed expiry rather than a phase-zero cancellation of its own opportunity. If the actual Action becomes unavailable,illegal or blocked,define failure/expiry without replacing the command or creating resources. An attached creature needs a real phase and budget; an expiry-only marker creates neither. Completed acts persist as actual history; ending the instruction cannot undo damage,payments or completed world changes.'),
('AG9-Q26',['puppetmaster-s-realm'],
 'Control BATTLEFIELD by REDIRECTING ATTACKS and BLOCKING MOVEMENTS for1minute; Core120ft casting range and no concentration.',
 'A: a fixed explicitly dimensioned zone with both active functions and nonconcentration minute. B: a following zone or concentration version as a disclosed addition.',
 'Confer on the actual substantial battlefield area,height,center range,LoE and eligible creatures rather than treating120ft as automatic radius. Both functions must be useful. Select owner awareness and command timing,any Action/Reaction charge and event frequency openly; a one-use or one-creature limiter is not recovered source. Realm is a control field,not a new cosmological plane.'),
('AG9-Q27',['puppetmaster-s-realm'],
 'Redirecting attacks lacks target-commitment window,range/source eligibility and result reuse.',
 'A: before attack RNG,retarget one eligible committed attack to a new actually legal recipient while preserving original actor and paid action. B: a stated post-roll redirect with full recalculation and disclosure policy.',
 'Recommend A unless the conference deliberately chooses the stronger post-roll power. Define melee/ranged/spell attacks,each Multiattack member,beneficial attacks,area spells and unseen actors. A new target must satisfy selected source geometry/eligibility; identify any explicit override rather than assume one. Retain original attack/damage provenance,resources and one hit/Wound resolution; no new cast/counter window or ownership flip. Reaction cost,if any,is NEW and must not quietly neuter the printed field.'),
('AG9-Q28',['puppetmaster-s-realm'],
 'Blocking movements leaves voluntary steps,forced displacement,teleportation and current in-flight motion distinct.',
 'A: prospective denial of actual eligible movement segments before committing them. B: a physical/source-owned barrier with complete body geometry.',
 'Select exact movement scope and cost/refund consequences; do not equate a rule denial with solid matter or automatically stop teleportation without a new explicit clause. State step boundaries,continuous motion,falling,forced movement,leaving the field and bodies already crossing its edge. No retroactive occupied illegal space,crushing damage or reset of spent movement. Blocking movement alone is not necessarily whole-Action denial,Speed0 or Root.'),
('AG9-Q29',['puppetmaster-s-realm'],
 'Competing realms,other redirectors and repeated input events can reroute forever or expose hidden actors.',
 'A: stable original-event IDs with deterministic opportunity order and one finite consumed decision per actual event. B: another bounded routing model with explicit terminal outcomes.',
 'Confer on which legal redirect wins and what the final attack/movement does; a loop-rejection guard alone is not a complete positive effect. Preserve useful control without multiplying charges on duplicate callbacks or granting free recasts. State interaction with actual reflected spells,damage-sharing stages and control instructions. Record only source-authorized player information; rendering,debug data and an unavailable prompt cannot disclose hidden enemies.'),
('AG9-Q30',['rewrite-loyalty'],
 'Target BELIEVES IT HAS ALWAYS SERVED YOUR CAUSE after failed CHA; the source does not rewrite actual history.',
 'A: a full subjective service/loyalty overlay with defined accessible autobiographical reconciliation. B: an explicitly wider memory rewrite with bounded content and preserved originals.',
 'Choose exactly what the target believes and remembers,what contradictions remain,and how a cause is concretely identified. Preserve the strong always-served promise without substituting a minor friendly attitude. No real past service,asset ownership,achievement,faction record or completed crafting is fabricated. Target and caster gain no unknown historical facts or hidden cause-membership oracle.'),
('AG9-Q31',['rewrite-loyalty'],
 'Core Instantaneous leaves whether the belief is a lasting completed mental change or an ongoing removable enchantment unresolved.',
 'A: a continuing nonconcentration overlay with an explicitly selected finite or indefinite lifetime. B: an instantaneous completed belief change with separately specified restoration rules.',
 'Director must choose persistence,dispel/antimagic behavior,contrary-evidence recovery and exact memory-restoration interface. A short one-turn duration would materially reduce the printed premise and needs justification. No unsupported universal curse tag or automatic RemoveCurse cure. Preserve original identity and prior memories once; duplicate/replaced overlays cannot overwrite the true restoration baseline or rewrite earlier independent memories.'),
('AG9-Q32',['rewrite-loyalty'],
 'Belief in lifelong service can affect behavior but does not expressly grant direct orders,alignment changes,real faction standing or oath immunity.',
 'A: genuine target decision-making from the specified altered belief with no automatic domination. B: a precisely authored additional command component,with its admission and action limits.',
 'Recommend A while making behavioral consequences concrete and useful: how duties,recognized allies,contrary causes and personal boundaries are evaluated. External reputation/membership,Paladin oaths and actual class access stay their real records unless expressly changed by a separate rule. Genuine resulting acts still have ordinary consequences. Resolve multiple casters/causes,immunity,restoration and post-expiry knowledge without silently granting protected secrets or bypassing control admission through the label belief.')]
FINDINGS=[
 'All nine complete native spell identities have rank9,class17,base26RP access; eight Enchantment routes are Wizard-only and ProphecyFulfilled is Cleric/Wizard Divination.',
 'All nine have one native placement each and preserved historical individual/common questions; no complete operational procedure or current encounter is promoted by this packet.',
 'AbsoluteDomination explicitly says WIS at end of each turn. That wording must be reconciled with real extra turns and attached-phase limits rather than replaced by a generic regular-turn default.',
 'DominateLegion promises up to ten simultaneous recipients,not ten new command budgets or invented creature profiles.',
 'EraseSoul names three-round identity loss and action denial; its parenthetical no-action wording conflicts with interpreting it as free casting. No actual soul destruction is printed.',
 'PerfectMesmerize requires a true continuing duration plus all three Stunned,silent,defenseless clauses and an exact damage break. Core Instantaneous supplies none of those missing details.',
 'OverwhelmingPresence preserves a real submission-or-fear alternative; outward worship is not cosmological proof. CommandReality and ProphecyFulfilled must perform actual legal behavior with existing budgets.',
 'PuppetmastersRealm promises both attack redirection and movement blocking. Geometry,cost,limits,information and conflict outcomes require full positive procedures.',
 'RewriteLoyalty is a subjective lifelong-service belief. Permanent objective faction/oath/class/world-history edits are not supplied by its source.',
 'The complete accepted-but-unapplied Control15 successor14 and Illusion14 context retain their true scope and whole-case content holds. The owner choices and COPY-READY-ALLOWANCE-02 remain settled.',
 'All recommendations below are unselected NEW candidates. Original sources,applied rules,counts,runtime flags and cosmology remain unchanged.'
]
CASES=[
 'For every identity, supply at least one source-qualified positive full encounter and an adverse meaningful branch,with actual acquired class/repertoire,initial RP/HP,Dissonance,components,actions,perception,positions,source DC/RNG,intermediate control budgets and final state. Source fixtures,not invented creature ratings or attacks,establish eligibility.',
 'AbsoluteDomination: a legal non-humanoid without an invented CR cap; initial save and an actual inserted-turn END escape; valid versus lost mental channel; an attached companion with genuine original-owner phases; repeated hard-denial history.',
 'CommandReality: a useful full sentence beyond a one-word order; a multi-step task at the selected duration boundary; invalid/resource-dependent wording; competing mandatory commands using one actual budget; Ready release with current target information.',
 'DominateLegion: ten real distinct recipients with different saves,initiatives and independent endings; two companions sharing one original owner; no free replacement slot,duplicate command or refreshed outside-initiative budget.',
 'EraseSoul: Core Action payment versus the no-action interpretation; three original hostile deadlines; early WIS success during suppression; distinct identity/denial immunity; old concentration not restored after a real loss.',
 'OverwhelmingPresence: actual submission and actual fear alternatives; a fear-immune target; a creature without ordinary kneeling anatomy; cover/entry/exit and changed choice at defined markers; CalmEmotions suppressing only fear.',
 'PerfectMesmerize: all three useful components,Stun-only immunity,preexisting concentration ending,full-duration survival without damage,fully prevented hit,tempHP absorption,damage redirected away and actual incoming transferred damage. Show the precise break checkpoint.',
 'ProphecyFulfilled: actual next legal Action with real attack/check outcome; an unavailable costly action; earlier conflicting mandate; an extra-turn or attached-phase boundary under the selected policy; finite expiry without invented opportunity.',
 'PuppetmastersRealm: one meaningful legal redirected attack and one blocked movement in the maintained field; illegal alternative target,Multiattack member,forced movement/teleport distinction,two competing realms,duplicate callbacks and hidden actor information.',
 'RewriteLoyalty: useful changed allegiance decisions with actual prior memories retained; contradictory evidence and restoration; incompatible later cause; real faction reputation/oath consequences remain objective; source-specific suppression versus ending behavior.',
 'Across all cases, separate current authored acceptance,source integrity,conditional fixture arithmetic,real engine execution,human gameplay,balance,cosmology and release. No missing full positive example is cleared by a rejection-only guard.'
]
